              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used homemade frozen vanilla yogurt and Smirnoff Whipped Vodka. I skipped the ice. This is off the HOOK. For me, I think that it could use double the vodka and a couple more strawberries but as is, I enjoyed it very much. EXCELLENT cocktail."
