              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Yoly"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I really liked this and will make it again. I used fresh frozen strawberries, omitted the ice and I used Amaretto only. It would be too strong for me had I used the optional vodka. Perfect without it.",
            "datePublished": "2017-12-28T22:33:29.470Z"
