              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Holiday Baker"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Yuummy!! I made 1/2 recipe to taste it. I used Edys 1/2 fat French vanilla ice cream. I didn't add the optional vodka, as I just don't care for vodka. I reduced the amaretto, upon reading the other reviews. I just did a couple spoonfuls. Probably, more of a flavoring than a mixed drink. I probably doubled the strawberries and vanilla extract too. The strawberries were frozen and hard to precisely measure. Either way, this does oddly taste like a strawberry shortcake. I bought a tiny bottle of amaretto, which I have never knowingly tasted, and found it to be delicious. TY",
